WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.510
得了吧，你连坐都坐不稳了。我送你回家。
Come on. You can barely sit up. I'll drive you home.

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.590
不用。我好着呢。好得很。
No. I'm good. I'm so good.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.070
