Kiss me.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.510
让他信以为真。
Make him believe it.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:50.770
他走了。
He's gone.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:52.770
嗯。
Yeah.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:01:00.010
好了。喝水。然后我送你回家。
Okay. Water. Then I'm taking you home.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.810
